eft unconnected if unused. Tying an output pin directly to GND is unusual and removes the status function.\", \"evidence\": [{\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(node (ref \\\"U5\\\") (pin \\\"9\\\") (pinfunction \\\"ST\\\") (pintype \\\"output\\\"))\"}, {\"source\": \"spec\", \"quote\": \"`ST`(pin9)/`GND`(pin12) go to `GND`.\"}], \"impact\": \"The power-mux status signal is unusable. The status pin is tied to ground and cannot indicate input switchover or fault, so this is a likely design error rather than an intended function.\", \"confidence\": 0.25}]}",
